###############################################################################
# PUBLIC CATALOG
############################################################################### Listagem paginada com filtros combinÃƒÂ¡veis.
###
# @name listProducts
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}&search=product&category=OFFICE&sellerId={{seedSellerId}}&inStock=true

###

@listedProductId = {{listProducts.response.body.$.data[0].id}}
@listedSellerId = {{listProducts.response.body.$.data[0].sellerId}}

### Busca case-insensitive por nome.
###
# @name searchProducts
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/search?q=office&page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}

### CatÃƒÂ¡logo filtrado por seller; sellerId ÃƒÂ© filtro pÃƒÂºblico de catÃƒÂ¡logo, nÃƒÂ£o ownership.
###
