GET {{baseUrl}}/products/category/OFFICE?page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}&inStock=true

### Detalhe de produto ativo.
###
# @name getProduct
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{seedProductId}}

### Consulta por mÃƒÂºltiplos IDs, retornando coleÃƒÂ§ÃƒÂ£o paginada.
###
# @name getMultipleProducts
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{seedProductId}},{{seedSecondProductId}}?page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}

